          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "pararenang mi kan Undru muka i inayan tremapaya dra patraka. yuyu i?",
          "chineseText": "我明天要和Undru去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
